                <p>Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 218, JCS Files, 3130 (10
                    Dec 65) Sec 1 IR 5216. Top Secret. The memorandum forms Enclosure A to a report
                    by the J–5 to the Joint Chiefs of Staff, February 28 (JCS 2143/268–2), which was
